{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10130100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10130100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1013010001:1":{"text":"Let me thank you all again for your huge help.","source_cn":"失礼了，请允许我再次感谢诸位的鼎力协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DCE254BE07B008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013010002:2":{"text":"We just did our best. Couldn't have done it without you all—the <style=\"highlight\">Templar Knights</style>!","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1013010002":{"text":"We just did our best. Couldn't have done it without you all—the <style=\"highlight\">Templar Knights</style>!","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013010003:2":{"text":"Aha, you caught me!","source_cn":"只是想说说看嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FE6254063282267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013010005:1":{"text":"Dura above, I'm a Templar Knight in charge of leading a small squad through Holistone.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我是隶属圣堂的圣骑士，目前带领一个小队途径圣石镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA644C8D4048F995E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013010006:1":{"text":"I'm the deputy captain, Lucius. We arrived at Holistone just in time to see the golems attack...","source_cn":"我是副队卢修斯，我们抵达圣石镇不久，恰好碰上魔偶来袭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF18FE2C6B6B6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013010007:1":{"text":"Please let me inform you, those creatures called golems...","source_cn":"请允许我告知各位，如今被称为“魔偶”的怪物——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x576470A5CBDC82F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013010008:1":{"text":"They were created for a good cause by Dura; therefore, stopping them from hurting humanity is our responsibility.","source_cn":"与女神和圣堂有关，阻止它们为祸人间，也是我们的责任所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C741990EB4FB282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013010009:1":{"text":"\"The road to hell is paved with good intentions.\" We'd be in way less trouble if your goddess had the forethought to make less of these things.","source_cn":"“善意之路，通往深渊。”你们的女神，当初就不能少慈爱一点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5AE17E7B36B549E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013010010:2":{"text":"... Please do not speak such blasphemy in front of me.","source_cn":"……你不够虔信，这并不是我的损失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931EAC984EA78ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"Imitating my words from earlier...?","source_cn":"真是耳熟……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23C599EE6228B7B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Imitating my words from earlier...?","female":"Imitating my words from earlier...?","variant_male_record_index":"62166","variant_female_record_index":"62167","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013010004:1":{"text":"Nevertheless, your help is greatly appreciated. I'd bow in thanks, though unfortunately my heavy armor won't allow me to.","source_cn":"重甲在身，不便行礼。如果我们的态度引起误会……我道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E76170F484CEB35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Please, it was our duty.","source_cn":"真是刺耳","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB372182A5D1033BA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Please, it was our duty.","female":"Please, it was our duty.","variant_male_record_index":"62168","variant_female_record_index":"62169","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"Temesia","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"Valen","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"Lucius","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}